      <h1>Gold Wash Plant Setup: <em>Complete Site Preparation</em></h1>
      <p>Don't let poor site preparation cost you thousands. Follow this comprehensive checklist to set up your gold wash plant operation for maximum efficiency and compliance.</p>
      <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin-top:16px">Published {{ datePublished | readableDate }} · Gold Wash Plants</p>
